\subsection{حماية Undelete بصلاحية Admin}
تم إضافة \texttt{[Authorize(Roles = SystemRoles.Admin)]} على جميع نقاط النهاية \texttt{Undelet/Undelete}:

\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=*]
    \item \texttt{ItemsController}
    \item \texttt{ItemSetsController}
    \item \texttt{MediaController}
    \item \texttt{PropertiesController}
    \item \texttt{ResourceTemplatesController}
    \item \texttt{VocabulariesController}
    \item \texttt{PatronsController} (الجديد)
    \item \texttt{ItemCopiesController} (الجديد)
\end{itemize}

